what is it with this game ? my friends were looking for a new game
, bored with spear of destiny.  I say HEY! here is a neat challenging
game for you to try,  they give it a shot install it, play the first
few moves, reboot, delete the game. and end up playing jill of the jungle
what is it with people who only like run/jump/shoot type games. I think
net hack is one of the best games for the money. No graphics yes but
the game is played int he mind rather than on the computer screen.
I may still be intreagued by not having ascended yet, but I love
trying all the possibilities, getting/reading scrolls and trying
out everything is what makes this best, So I may end up with a +12
ac with cursed boots of levitation wearing a cursed ring og aggrevate
monster and a cursed ring of hunger, gloves of fumbling and a cursed
amulet of restfull sleep, BUT I LOVE IT!!!!!!    
thanks dev team, maybe someday whan I learn C I will be able to make
some contributions....

